# This project requires no environment variables.
#
# It is a fully static site: no backend, no database, no API keys, and no
# external services at runtime. Learning progress lives in the browser's
# localStorage and is never transmitted anywhere.
#
# This file is a placeholder so that `cp .env.example .env` is safe and so the
# absence of required configuration is explicit rather than looking like an
# oversight. Do not add secrets here.
